    "text": "9 hours ago OLEAN — Olean Common Council members got an update Tuesday on the Olean Homelessness Task Force appointed by Mayor Bill Aiello. The update from the mayor and Alderman Sonya McCall, D-Ward 4, was largely anecdotal, although McCall said the homeless revolve around poverty, mental health issues, substance abuse and a lack of safe, affordable housing. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
